mastery.text:
Once per {{term:long-rest|long rest}}, you can transform into a physical manifestation of your element. When you do, describe your transformation and choose two of the following benefits to gain until your next rest:

- +4 bonus to your {{term:damage-thresholds|Severe threshold}}
- +1 bonus to a character trait of your choice
- +1 bonus to your {{term:proficiency|Proficiency}}
- +2 bonus to your {{term:evasion|Evasion}}
